{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "ce862772-7438-8532-a6ad-ecdc0160d9dd",
  "created_at": "2026-02-04T11:41:24-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Recreation",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Rosemarie D. Barone",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Beth Almeida",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:03-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Recreation Department, this is Beth, how can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:08-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Hi, um, hello. Sorry to bother you. I'm not sure if I have the right office. I'm trying to find out about the winter basketball for kids?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:19-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You've got the right place. Youth basketball, sure. What would you like to know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:25-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, great. So, how do I sign up? Is there a form, or is it online, or do I come in? I looked on the website and I think I got to the wrong page. It said something about spring."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:41-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, that happens, the spring stuff tends to get posted early. For winter basketball you can register through the recreation page or fill out a paper form here at the office. Which would you rather do?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:37:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, which one is easier? Sorry. I don't want to do it wrong."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:38:02-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, you're fine. Honestly the paper form is pretty simple if you can stop by. Online works too if you've got a computer handy."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:38:12-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Okay, [line breaks up] sorry, can you hear me? I'm in the car and it's cutting out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:38:20-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I lost you for a second there. I got the part about being in the car. Can you hear me okay now?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:38:29-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, now I can. Sorry. So the, um, the age thing. How old do they have to be? My nephew is eight, but I think he might be nine by the time it starts? Or is it by the end? I don't know how that works."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:38:47-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good question. Usually these leagues are split into age groups, and they go by the child's age on a certain date, not necessarily when it starts. I don't have the cutoff date in front of me, so let me pull up the sheet. Can you hold a moment?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:39:06-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, sure, of course. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:39:09-05:00",
      "duration": 16,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, I'm back. So the groups here are by grade range and age, and the sheet says the youngest are around seven, and it goes up through the middle school years. Eight or nine would both be in the younger group."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:39:25-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh. So it's grades, or it's ages? Sorry, I'm confused. Which one counts?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:39:31-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Both are listed, and the form asks for his birthday and his grade. If you put both, they'll place him. So you don't have to figure out the cutoff yourself."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:39:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So I just put the birthday and, um, the grade. And he's in third grade. Does that matter?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Third grade is right in the younger group. You're all set on that."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:39:57-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. And that's the winter one, not the spring one, right? I want to make sure. I'm sorry for asking again."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:40:06-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No worries at all. Yes, the form should say winter basketball at the top. If it says spring, it's the wrong one."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:40:15-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, good. Um, [line breaks up] [inaudible] and I think the signal is getting bad again. If it drops, is it okay if I call back later? Or do I have to start over with somebody?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:40:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Absolutely, call back anytime. Just ask for recreation and whoever picks up can help. You won't be starting from scratch, the form is the main thing anyway."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:40:41-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, thank you. So, to check, I get the winter form, put his birthday and grade, and eight is fine for the younger group. Did I get that right?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:40:53-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You got it exactly right."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:40:56-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Sorry, one more thing, [crosstalk] do I need to bring anything when I drop it off?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:41:03-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Just the filled-out form. If there's anything else needed, we'll let you know when we look it over."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:41:11-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Thank you so much. Sorry again for all the questions."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:41:16-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Not a problem at all, that's what we're here for. Have a good afternoon!"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-04T11:41:22-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "You too. Bye."
    }
  ],
